**Placement rationale.** One schema file with two `$anchor`s rather than two files,
because the ingest profile is a *strict restriction* of the stored profile — they must not
be able to drift. `$defs/envelope_base` holds every property name exactly once; the two
profiles only re-constrain names already declared there. This is what lets the envelope be
**closed** (§2.3) without the classic draft-2020-12 composition bug.

**No new runtime module, no new dependency in the product tree.** `jsonschema` is a *test*
dependency only; the schema file itself is inert JSON.

